{#- The five Free.ai doors. Included inside every admin panel, and shown
    only once the order's passcode has actually opened one — the markup is
    inert without it, and the keys live on the server. -#}
<div class="freeai" data-fa="root" data-fa-where="{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}" hidden>
  <div class="divider">&#10022;</div>
  <p class="kicker">Free.ai &mdash; the order&rsquo;s five doors</p>
  <p class="muted xsmall">Administrators only. The accounts behind these doors are never named
  here: they are Free.ai 1 to 5, in a fixed order. Each carries a free pool of 30,000 tokens a
  day, which is six pictures or one film, and the pool resets at midnight UTC.</p>

  <div class="btn-row">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--small" data-fa="check">Check the doors</button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--small btn--ghost" data-fa="load-models">Load the model list</button>
    <span class="muted xsmall" data-fa="msg"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="cell-table" data-fa="table" hidden>
      <caption class="ds-cap">What each door has left today. Counted by this site as it spends,
      not read from Free.ai &mdash; anything spent elsewhere on the same account is not in these
      numbers.</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Door</th>
          <th scope="col">Tokens left</th>
          <th scope="col">Resets in</th>
          <th scope="col">Films left</th>
          <th scope="col">Films reset in</th>
          <th scope="col">Pictures left</th>
          <th scope="col">Requests this month</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody data-fa="rows"></tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="am-fields">
    <div>
      <label for="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-chat">Chat model (admins)</label>
      <select id="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-chat" data-fa="model-chat">
        <option value="">Qwen 2.5 7B &mdash; self-hosted, cheapest</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-image">Picture model (admins)</label>
      <select id="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-image" data-fa="model-image">
        <option value="">FLUX.2 Klein &mdash; self-hosted</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-video">Film model (admins)</label>
      <select id="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-video" data-fa="model-video">
        <option value="">CogVideoX &mdash; self-hosted</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-door">Which door to use</label>
      <select id="fa-{{ faWhere | default('admin') }}-door" data-fa="door">
        <option value="">Whichever answers first</option>
        <option value="1">Free.ai 1</option>
        <option value="2">Free.ai 2</option>
        <option value="3">Free.ai 3</option>
        <option value="4">Free.ai 4</option>
        <option value="5">Free.ai 5</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="muted xsmall">These choices are remembered on this device and used by the order&rsquo;s
  own work &mdash; the oracle&rsquo;s answers, the pictures and the films &mdash; whenever an
  administrator is the one asking.</p>
</div>
